# Interwjuer

Production-quality Job Application Tracker SaaS. NOT a tutorial or MVP throwaway —
favor long-term maintainability over less code. Portfolio-quality, testable, scalable.

## Problem it solves

Software engineers rarely track interview questions, weak areas, and rejection
reasons, so they repeat the same mistakes. Interwjuer turns interview experience
into concrete insights and a learning plan. See `docs/vision.md` for full context.

## Tech stack

- **Frontend**: Next.js App Router, React, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui
- **Backend**: Hono, TypeScript, Prisma, PostgreSQL
- **Infra**: pnpm workspace, Docker (Postgres locally)

## Monorepo boundaries

| Path                   | Purpose             |
| ----------------------- | -------------------- |
| `src/`                  | Next.js frontend     |
| `apps/api/`             | REST API (Hono)      |
| `packages/contracts/`   | Shared DTOs          |
| `prisma/`               | Schema, migrations, seed |

Web and API communicate **only over HTTP**. Never import backend code into the
frontend, and never import `@prisma/client` outside `apps/api/src/infrastructure/`.
